 time (9 in total), using 1 hand only, and places them into holes on the board as quickly as possible, in any order until all holes are filled. Then, without pausing, the participant removes the pegs 1 at a time and returns them as quickly as possible. Each participant performs this task twice with each hand separately. Results on both tests are then averaged for an overall task completion time.","populationDescription":"FAS included all randomized participant who received at least 1 dose of the study drug for the treatment period. Number analyzed is the number of participants with data available for analysis at the given time-point.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","timeFrame":"Baseline up to Week 12","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Placebo","description":"TAK-831 placebo-matching tablets, orally, twice daily for up to 12 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"TAK-831 75 mg","description":"TAK-831 75 mg, tablets, orally, twice daily for up to 12 weeks."},{"id":"OG002","title":"TAK-831 300 mg","description":"TAK-831 300 mg, tablets, orally, twice daily for up to 12 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"27"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"14"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"26"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"At Least 15% Reduction from Baseline","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"3"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"0"}]}]},{"title":"At Least 20% Reduction from Baseline","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"0"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"At Least 15% Reduction from Baseline","nonInferiorityType":"SUPERIORITY","pValue":">0.999","pValueComment":"P-value was from Fisher's exact test. Odds ratio was obtained from Cochran-Mantel-Haenszel with ambulation status at randomization as a stratification factor.","stati